Package: skillkorp-m20
Version: 1.3.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, udev, gir1.2-notify-0.7
Recommends: gir1.2-ayatanaappindicator3-0.1 | gir1.2-appindicator3-0.1
Maintainer: nplacide <nplacide95@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/ElMajor76/skillkorp-m20
Description: Linux driver, CLI, and GUI for SkillKorp M20 Ultimate gaming mouse
 Native Linux implementation of hardware driver, CLI tool (m20ctl),
 and modern GTK 4 / Libadwaita GUI for the SkillKorp M20 Ultimate
 wireless mouse (PixArt PAW3395 sensor & Beken BK3633 microcontroller).
